; orchard_ridge.room - Crista do Vento (WORLD-35; design 04 section 3.6), over orchard_leaf_path.
; In from orchard_windy_gap's gate (east, rows 6-8 under its shelf; Soltar + Vendaval) or from orchard_crag (west,
; rows 1-4, floor row 5; wall climb). The letter is on the knoll.
; The drop shaft (cols 2-4, stone walls down to row 11) lands in the leaf path's soft landing by the arena's mouth.
; Its lips (row 5) are 512 px over that floor, past a Redoma shell plus a double jump (462). Over cols 6-36 the crest
; ends at row 8 (y -1632), above a base jump from the leaf path's hill (head y -1605), with an earth [back] wall in the
; gap. So the drop is one-way for every kit without wall climb.

